hinking","willing","judging"],"leaves_for":[],"note":"1975 年 12 月 4 日在纽约因心脏病去世时未完成，判断卷只留标题页与两页题词。未完成本身就是结论。","period":"1970-1975","published":1978,"published_note":"遗作，1978 年由 Mary McCarthy 编辑出版；判断卷未完成","question":"思考、意志、判断，这三件心灵做的事，到底是什么？","revises":["thoughtlessness","banality-of-evil"],"title_en":"The Life of the Mind","title_zh":"《心灵生活》","written_end":1975,"written_start":1970},{"id":"lectures-kant","introduces":["judging","sensus-communis","enlarged-mentality"],"leaves_for":[],"note":"1970 年秋新学院讲课稿。判断力来自康德《判断力批判》，但被她改造成政治判断。","period":"1970-1975","published":1982,"published_note":"遗作讲稿，1982 年出版","question":"没有标准的判断，凭什么判断？","revises":["thinking"],"title_en":"Lectures on Kant's Political Philosophy","title_zh":"《康德政治哲学讲稿》","written_end":1970,"written_start":1970}]}